# autotranslate dev/handover tools (.scala) ARE tracked; only their generated outputs + build dirs are not
autotranslate/scratch/*.txt
# ...except these two, which are INPUT fixtures for todo-triage.scala rather than outputs: the only way
# anyone else can re-check that tool's parsing, and its pdf oracle, without the private reading log
!autotranslate/scratch/todo-sample.txt
!autotranslate/scratch/todo-sample-pdf.txt
